      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} I currently do not have anything I can provide to show the issue, and unsure how I would access the log files. \n\nI did have this issue occur last night when I left and rejoined a Murder 4 lobby full of my friends. I had 3 people who were in the same spot I left them in, however when they moved it did not show on my end, instead I could only see them in the position (while looking like they are in Desktop mode) that they were in when I joined back, and I could hear them from where I could see them, but that did not reflect what they were doing and their actual location.",
